<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-KONYSHEV WINS 18TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-KONYSHEV WINS 18TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>ZARAGOZA, Spain 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dmitry Konyshev of Russia won the 18th stage of the Tour of Spain over 222 kms from Cerler to Zaragoza on Wednesday. </p>
<p>Alex Zuelle of Switzerland retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
